      55.17,
      403.98,
      295.24,
      452.94
    ],
    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilake, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
